OL,3,AYemeni forces' retreat leaves Houthis
OL,4,Ain control of key Red Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia have said they are
OL,8,Fwithdrawing from an area overlooking
OL,9,Fthe strategically important Bab
OL,10,Fal-Mandab Strait, leaving it under the
OL,11,Fcontrol of the Iran-backed Houthi
OL,12,Fmovement.
OL,14,FYemen's military said it was
OL,15,Fredeploying troops from the key
OL,16,Fshipping gateway at the southern end of
OL,17,Fthe Red Sea to defend its interim
OL,18,Fcapital, Aden.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
